{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13393","headline":"百丈谿新理茅茨读书 · 阎防","name":"百丈谿新理茅茨读书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浪迹弃人世，远山自幽独。\n始傍巢由踪，吾其获心曲。\n荒庭何所有，老树半空腹。\n秋蜩鸣北林，暮鸟穿我屋。\n栖迟乐遵渚，恬旷寡所欲。\n开卦推盈虚，散帙攻节目。\n养闲度人事，达命知止足。\n不学东周儒，俟时劳伐辐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}